# Resolved with hashes into mlx-audio-requirements.txt for Apple Silicon macOS.
# webrtcvad publishes no usable wheel; the installer permits only its
# hash-authenticated source archive, constrains its isolated build backend with
# mlx-audio-build-constraints.txt, and requires wheels for everything else.
# mlx-audio 0.5.0's `server` extra unnecessarily caps setuptools below 81,
# which is vulnerable. Keep the library's STT/TTS extras and spell out the
# server runtime it documents so the resolver can select a patched setuptools.
